OL,3,ASaudi employee charged with planting
OL,4,Arecording device in OpenAI office
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Saudi national has been charged with
OL,7,Fsecretly planting a recording device in
OL,8,Fone of OpenAI's offices in California,
OL,9,Ffederal prosecutors announced.
OL,11,FAbdulrahman Alfozan, who worked at the
OL,12,FAI firm as an engineer, was charged
OL,13,Ffederally with using or endeavouring to
OL,14,Fuse an electronic, mechanical, or other
OL,15,Fdevice to intercept oral
OL,16,Fcommunications.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
